{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56523","headline":"石胆歌 · 徐真君","name":"石胆歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白珠碧水平铛中，文武微微声渐雄。\n一伏三时成半死，再烹经宿变成铜。\n将军此朝须舞剑，青腰小儿莫相猒。\n白霜理石常煞人，黄矾石胆从来艳。\n铁埚土釜各文武，一须五时连夜煮。\n开匣见玉须焚香，仙人遇之名长久。\n（唐金陵子《龙虎还丹诀》卷下。\n原署「天目徐真君」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐真君","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56523.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56523","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}